      "answer": "The temporary field mappings planned in the SI-CLOUD-ROUTER transform for the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot are: mapping txn_id to transaction_id, total_amount to amount_cents with type coercion from string to int, and preserving key fields store_id and register_id. The transform will add a flag field _ns_transform=true and enable OR-AUDIT-LOGS for each transformed event to ensure safety and auditability.\n\nThe March 23 workshop is a Schema Signoff Workshop with attendees including Sophie Tremblay, Marc Gauthier, Ellen Park, Platform engineers, and Northstar SE/Ing teams. Its agenda is to agree on a canonical schema for payment, register_events, and sensor_thermo events, define alias mapping, and plan producer migration. The deliverable is a signed schema document uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG and a change control ticket with producer migration milestones. [art_5a91258f4056] [art_6c5bb3a4b89f]",
